BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:📖 How to read your calendar
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261008
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261009
DTSTAMP:20261008T203129Z
UID:legend-c008-v2@jentm1-arch.github.io/calendario-astral
DESCRIPTION:Each event has an emoji that tells you what it's about:\n\n
 🔥 action & energy\n💬 communication & decisions\n💗 love\, relation
 ships & pleasure\n💸 money\, worth & talents\n🍀 growth & luck\n🧱 c
 ommitment & effort\n⚡ sudden change\n🌫️ intuition (or confusion)\n
 🌋 deep transformation\n☀️ identity & vitality\n🌑 New Moon: time 
 to begin\n🌕 Full Moon: time to close\n🌘 eclipse & eclipse season\n
 ☂️ shadow before a retrograde (next to the planet's icon)\n🗓️ mon
 th summary (on the 1st)\n\nThe emoji next to “Updated” (🍇\, 🐝…
 ) changes when there is a new version of your calendar.\n\nOpen each event
  to read your personal interpretation.\n\nHow to read each event:\n🟠 wh
 at is going on\n🟢 If it feels right\, do: suggestions\, never orders\n
 🟡 If you can\, avoid\n🟣 → a question for you\n🔵 Aspect: the ast
 rological detail\, in case you want to learn\n\nSymbols in the “Aspect
 ” line:\n☉ Sun · ☽ Moon · ☿ Mercury · ♀ Venus · ♂ Mars · 
 ♃ Jupiter · ♄ Saturn · ♅ Uranus · ♆ Neptune · ♇ Pluto · ⚷
  Chiron · ☊ Node\n☌ conjunction · ☍ opposition · □ square · 
 △ trine · ⚹ sextile\n℞ retrograde\n“in house X” = the life area
  where it happens · “influences” = the areas that receive the mark.\n
 \n—\nIris Calendar\n🦋 Updated on 08 Oct 2026\nhttps://mi-calendario-a
 stral.netlify.app
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://mi-calendario-astral.netlify.app
