DESCRIPTION:🟠 The Sun clashes with your natal Mercury today\, pushing y
 ou to speak up about something you've kept too quiet about at home or in h
 ow you present yourself. This lands at the peak of a slower Saturn pressur
 e on the same point\, asking you to take it seriously.\n\n🟢 If it feels
  right\, do:\n• Write down what you actually think before any talk with 
 family\n• Plan what you want to say\, even if you say it later\n\n🟡 I
 f you can\, avoid:\n• Sending a decisive message about shared resources 
 or debt right now\n• Forcing a conversation with your partner before you
 've thought it through\n\n🟣 → Mercury is in shadow until November 13 
 and Venus is retrograde until November 14\, so this isn't the day to launc
 h anything new in love or money — plan it\, don't seal it. What truth ab
 out yourself have you been editing before you let it out\, and why?\n\n
 🔵 Aspect: ☉ (15°27' Libra\, in house 5) □ ☿ natal (15°27' Capri
 corn\, in house 8) · exact 08/10 18:39\nHow it connects: origin in houses
  7 and 8 → lived in house 5 → influences house 4 (ruled by ☉) · hou
 ses 1 and 5 (ruled by ☿)\n\n—\nIris Calendar\n🦋 Updated on 08 Oct 2
 026\nhttps://mi-calendario-astral.netlify.app
