  your house of daily routine\, asking you to revisit what you truly want f
 rom love\, money and your own habits before moving forward. Mercury briefl
 y meets your natal Saturn and clashes with your natal Midheaven\, stirring
  tension between structure and career image\; the Sun echoes both contacts
  days later. Mars in Leo clashes with your natal Venus on November 8\, the
  sharpest point of a bigger Jupiter square testing your sense of worth in 
 love and money. The New Moon on November 9 lands quietly in this same hous
 e of routine\, joined by Saturn\, inviting a serious reset of habits and h
 ealth. Venus turns direct on November 11\, Mercury on November 12\, and bo
 th spend the rest of the month re-crossing retrograde ground — look back
  at August through mid-November to understand what's settling now. The Sun
  enters Sagittarius on the 22nd and later a Full Moon in Gemini stirs your
  house of rest\, both touching your natal Chiron and reopening an old woun
 d around feeling not good enough. Mars then moves into your house of home
 \, clashing with that same Chiron.\n\nIn the background\, Pluto squares it
 s own natal position in your house of daily routine\, its peak phase pushi
 ng you to build real structures around power and control you first inherit
 ed at birth. Neptune squares your natal Sun and Neptune together\, peaking
  in a long process (begun around your birth) about blending your identity 
 with something larger than yourself. Saturn squares your natal Mercury\, a
 sking for mature follow-through on a commitment to communication or learni
 ng that began in 2019. Jupiter's square to your natal Venus reaches its la
 st pass\, asking you to finally integrate what you've learned about your o
 wn worth since 2018\, while a newer Jupiter square to your natal Chiron as
 ks you to act on healing you began in 2024. Uranus opposes its own natal p
 osition\, a once-in-a-lifetime mirror moment about freedom in your house o
 f daily routine\, while also beginning a long\, inherited conjunction with
  your natal Ascendant that touches your very identity. Jupiter's conjuncti
 on to your natal IC opens a brand new cycle about home and family\, replac
 ing the one that began in 2015.\n\nYou will find more information and deta
 il in the events of November in your calendar. Happy November! ✨\n\n—
 \nIris Calendar\n🦋 Updated on 08 Oct 2026\nhttps://mi-calendario-astral
 .netlify.app
